cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Submission Desk: a deterministic journal-selection tool for manuscript submission"
message: >-
  If you use this tool, please cite it as below. For any claim about the
  underlying method, please cite the primary research listed in `references`.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Submission Desk contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/submission-desk"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free, single-file web tool that turns journal selection into a
  reproducible procedure: binary eligibility gates, an explicit scoring model
  combining impact factor, acceptance rate, manuscript-journal fit, time to
  first decision and article processing charge, a fixed submission status flow,
  and an editable timeline. Ships in English and Traditional Chinese.
keywords:
  - scholarly publishing
  - journal selection
  - peer review
  - decision support
  - research workflow
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-07-24"
